As permitted by Section 7 of the AGPLv3, the following additional terms apply to the Software:

**(a) Preservation of notices and attribution (Section 7(b)).** You must keep intact all copyright notices, this legal notice, and the author attribution "Original work by Nasko Gashi and CODON, kosova.report" in the source files and in the "About", footer or legal-notice area of any user interface of a modified version. Modified versions must be marked as changed and must not claim to be the original.

