### 2.1 Scope

"The Content" means all non-code material authored by or for the Licensors and made available in or through this repository or the kosova.report platform. This includes written reports, articles and news posts, journalism, research text, analyses, documentation (including `README.md` and guides), training material, datasets and statistics compiled by the Licensors, PDF documents, and images, illustrations and maps created for the project. It does not include the Software (Part 1), the Brand (Part 3) or the third-party material in Part 4.

