The licenses in Parts 1 and 2 cover only material in which the Licensors hold the rights. They **do not** apply to the following, which remain under their own terms and with their own owners:

- **Fonts:** Sofia Sans and Sofia Sans Extra Condensed, © The Sofia Sans Project Authors, licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (see `src/fonts/OFL-SofiaSans.txt`).
- **Partner and supporter logos:** the logos of CIVICUS, Metamorphosis Foundation, TechSoup, Digital Activism Program and Sbunker (in `public/logos/` and in storage) are the property of their respective owners. They are shown only to acknowledge support and partnership, and may not be reused without their owners' permission.
- **Software dependencies:** libraries installed through npm (including Next.js, React, Leaflet, jsPDF and others) are licensed by their authors under their own licenses.
- **Map data and tiles:** © OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the Open Database License (ODbL). Municipal boundary data remains under the terms of its original source.
- **User submissions:** reports, descriptions, photos and comments submitted by members of the public remain the property of the people who submitted them. They are handled under the platform's privacy notice and are not licensed to anyone under this document.

